  "description": "Proper performance for riders who don't want to blow the budget. Our high-value aluminium 160 mm full-suspension frame is paired with a powerful Bosch drive unit and high-capacity battery to deliver a fun and capable ride at a price that's hard to ignore.\n\nThe ETMO 800 delivers serious performance on the trail without hammering your wallet. We've combined our high-value aluminium 160 mm travel frame with Bosch's powerful 120 Nm CX drive unit and big 800 Wh battery, so you can explore for hours or lap your favourite loops all day long. With mixed-size wheels for a fun but stable ride and our proven geometry, you're guaranteed fun whether you're a fresh face to mountain biking or an experienced hand. Quality kit from Shimano handles stopping and drivetrain duty, while Marzocchi's legendary Bomber suspension, including a stout 38 mm stanchion fork, takes care of the bumps.\n\nA quality e-MTB means more runs, more fun, and more time just getting out there. This is why we’ve created the MERIDA ETMO, our most price-focussed Bosch-powered e-MTB ever. We’ve used all our aluminium frame design and manufacturing know-how to create a durable frame that takes inspiration from the award-winning long-travel eONE-EIGHTY, but in an extra versatile and affordable package. The ETMO uses 160 mm of travel* at either end and mixed wheel sizes, so it’s fun and fast on any terrain, with handling that’ll bring a smile to the face of experienced riders and fresh faces alike. We've backed this up with our lifetime frame warranty, too.\n\nWith the proven and trusted power of Bosch pedal assistance, the ETMO offers battery and drive unit options for every need and wallet, with 540, 600 or 800 Wh internal batteries and the choice of powerful CX or high-value PX drive units depending on the model. We also have EQ models that come fully equipped with fenders, lights, a kickstand and a rear rack for urban SUV use, plus PRO models that have upgraded drive unit and battery specs.\n\n*Some models come with 140 mm fork and and 143 mm rear travel.",
